docs {
  ## Get Story
  
  Retrieves a story by its unique ID for the authenticated user.
  - If the story `isUnlocked` is `true`, the response returns the full story content (`fullContent`).
  - If the story `isUnlocked` is `false`, the response returns a `preview` of the story instead of `fullContent`.
  
  This endpoint requires a valid JWT bearer token.
  
  ### Path Parameters
  
  | Field | Type   | Constraints | Description                         |
  |-------|--------|-------------|-------------------------------------|
  | `id`  | string | UUID v4     | The unique ID of the story to fetch. |
  
  ### Success Response — `200 OK` (Unlocked Story)
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "story 8f8cf906-3459-414a-85fb-99b0fdf156d7 found successfully",
    "data": {
      "id": "8f8cf906-3459-414a-85fb-99b0fdf156d7",
      "userId": "f0e1d2c3-b4a5-6789-0abc-def123456789",
      "fullContent": "Ember the Dragon had always believed fire was meant to destroy...",
      "isUnlocked": true,
      "stripeCheckoutSessionId": "cs_test_a1b2c3d4e5f67890",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-11T15:30:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": null,
      "deletedAt": null
    },
    "meta": null
  }
  ```
  
  ### Success Response — `200 OK` (Locked Story)
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "story 8f8cf906-3459-414a-85fb-99b0fdf156d7 found successfully",
    "data": {
      "preview": "Ember the Dragon had always believed fire was meant to destroy...",
      "id": "8f8cf906-3459-414a-85fb-99b0fdf156d7",
      "userId": "f0e1d2c3-b4a5-6789-0abc-def123456789",
      "isUnlocked": false,
      "stripeCheckoutSessionId": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-11T15:30:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": null,
      "deletedAt": null
    },
    "meta": null
  }
  ```
  
  ### Error Responses
  
  #### `400 Bad Request` — Invalid UUID
  
  Returned when the `:id` path parameter is not a valid UUID format.
  
  ```json
  {
    "statusCode": 400,
    "message": "Validation failed (uuid is expected)",
    "error": "Bad Request"
  }
  ```
  
  #### `401 Unauthorized` — Missing or Invalid JWT
  
  Returned when no bearer token is provided or the token is invalid/expired.
  
  ```json
  {
    "statusCode": 401,
    "message": "Unauthorized"
  }
  ```
  
  #### `404 Not Found` — Story Not Found
  
  Returned when no story matches the given ID for the authenticated user.
  
  ```json
  {
    "statusCode": 404,
    "message": "Story 8f8cf906-3459-414a-85fb-99b0fdf156d7 not found",
    "error": "Not Found"
  }
  ```
}
